  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How do I submit the P45 to HMRC?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at 12:28 PM\n\n\t\t1. It is necessary to run at least a single payroll to notify the Leaver to the HMRC and generate the Form P45. (If there is no pay you may run zero payrolls)\n\n2. Once done you may download the P45 by following the below link\n\nReports>> Additional Forms>> P45\n\nWatch here how to record an employee as leaving and generate P45\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
